 is a non-terminal checkpoint: it reports and","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"consumes the current pending snapshot, then continues observing. "},{"code":"finish()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"closes the queue, consumes its final snapshot, and reports the first event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"emitted after that boundary in both exhaustivity modes."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Swift Testing currently attributes issues recorded inside an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"isolated ","type":"text"},{"code":"deinit","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to an ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"unknown test"}]},{"text":" rather than to the test that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"owned the store, which makes a deinit-time leftover-event failure","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"hard to locate. Until that is resolved upstream, await all work and end","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"each test with an explicit ","type":"text"},{"code":"finish()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". It runs the strict check with the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"caller’s source location and disarms the deinit-time fallback.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","name":"Note"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.effects\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting"]]},"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.effects\/SQ","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.effects\/SH","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.effects\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.effects\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"kind":"relationships"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"ident